{"id":"c8434cbb-0e6e-44ae-aa96-b620d1c0e085","revision":0,"last_node_id":90,"last_link_id":164,"nodes":[{"id":17,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-218.1480577256944,4032.815212673615],"size":[530,290],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"How to use","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"8.0.1"},"widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["## p-h3-image\n\n**Text to image:** write your request after `Request:` in the prompt box. The prompt upsampler expands it before sampling.\n\n**Size:** the Resolution Selector sets the canvas — pick the aspect ratio, a megapixel target and a rounding multiple (8.0 MP with multiple 32 lands on 3360×2496 for 4:3). Keep the `Aspect ratio:` line in the request in sync with the selector, otherwise the prompt asks for one shape and the latent produces another.\n\n| Selector ratio | Size at 8.0 MP, multiple 32 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1:1 (Square) | 2912×2912 |\n| 4:3 (Standard) | 3360×2496 |\n| 3:2 (Photo) | 3552×2368 |\n| 16:9 (Widescreen) | 3872×2176 |\n| 3:4 (Portrait Standard) | 2496×3360 |\n| 2:3 (Portrait Photo) | 2368×3552 |\n| 9:16 (Portrait Widescreen) | 2176×3872 |\n\nSampling is an 8-step distilled schedule (`ManualSigmas` + `er_sde`, CFG 1) — more steps do not help. Set seed control to `randomize` for new images and back to `fixed` to reproduce the shipped example.\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## p-h3-image\n\n**Text to image:** write your request after `Request:` in the prompt box. The prompt upsampler expands it before sampling.\n\n**Size:** the Resolution Selector sets the canvas — pick the aspect ratio, a megapixel target and a rounding multiple (8.0 MP with multiple 32 lands on 3360×2496 for 4:3). Keep the `Aspect ratio:` line in the request in sync with the selector, otherwise the prompt asks for one shape and the latent produces another.\n\n| Selector ratio | Size at 8.0 MP, multiple 32 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1:1 (Square) | 2912×2912 |\n| 4:3 (Standard) | 3360×2496 |\n| 3:2 (Photo) | 3552×2368 |\n| 16:9 (Widescreen) | 3872×2176 |\n| 3:4 (Portrait Standard) | 2496×3360 |\n| 2:3 (Portrait Photo) | 2368×3552 |\n| 9:16 (Portrait Widescreen) | 2176×3872 |\n\nSampling is an 8-step distilled schedule (`ManualSigmas` + `er_sde`, CFG 1) — more steps do not help. Set seed control to `randomize` for new images and back to `fixed` to reproduce the shipped example.\n"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":32,"type":"ResolutionSelector","pos":[-541.684418718879,888.9997426933462],"size":[270,150],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"showAdvanced":false,"inputs":[{"label":"aspect_ratio","localized_name":"宽高比","name":"aspect_ratio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"aspect_ratio"},"link":null},{"label":"megapixels","localized_name":"百万像素","name":"megapixels","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"megapixels"},"link":null},{"label":"multiple","localized_name":"倍数","name":"multiple","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"multiple"},"link":null},{"label":"preview","localized_name":"预览","name":"preview","shape":7,"type":"RESOLUTION_PREVIEW","widget":{"name":"preview"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"width","localized_name":"宽度","name":"width","type":"INT","links":[91]},{"label":"height","localized_name":"高度","name":"height","type":"INT","links":[92]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ResolutionSelector","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.45.0","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"8.0.1"},"widget_ue_connectable":{"preview":true,"aspect_ratio":true,"megapixels":true,"multiple":true}},"widgets_values":["16:9 (Widescreen)",16,32],"widgets_values_named":{"aspect_ratio":"16:9 (Widescreen)","megapixels":16,"multiple":32}},{"id":35,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[-1497.3048668503227,-137.6538108356291],"size":[420,90],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"showAdvanced":false,"inputs":[{"label":"unet_name","localized_name":"UNet名称","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"l